# Personal website and Sentinel Grid frontend

This is a static GitHub Pages site. `index.html` contains the portfolio and AI/cyber news center; `sentinel.html` contains the dedicated MapLibre intelligence map.

## Frontend structure

- `assets/js/site.js` — portfolio, project viewer, background rotation, and AI/cyber feed
- `assets/js/sentinel-data.js` — Sentinel manifest/health publication client shared by both pages
- `assets/js/sentinel-home.js` — Sentinel status summary on the homepage
- `assets/js/sentinel-map.js` — dedicated map rendering, filters, layers, and event details
- `assets/css/sentinel-map.css` — map-only styling
- `data/` — static data synchronized by `.github/workflows/sync-states.yml`

No build step or paid service is required. Serve the repository with any static HTTP server for local testing; opening files directly can prevent browsers from fetching local JSON.
